    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Oh my, from a foreign land— I heard about the\r\nbridge before the Great Temple.\r\nJust when I thought the repairs were finished...\r\nnow they say a fiend has appeared.",
        "Jp" : "あら、異国の――\r\n聞きましたよ、大神殿前の橋のこと\r\n修繕が終わったと思ったら、今度は\r\nデーモンが現れたんですってね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 592599,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Because you've been stirring up this village, the\r\nChief has e'en started saying the ruins\r\nought to be investigated.",
        "Jp" : "あなたがこの村をひっかき回すから\r\n族長も遺跡を調査すべきだ、なんて\r\n言い始めたじゃないですか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544766,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The fiend's appearance, you see... 'tis the\r\nresult of incurring the ancestors' wrath for\r\ntrying to set foot in the ruins.",
        "Jp" : "デーモン出現はね、遺跡に\r\n足を踏み入れようとしたせいで\r\n祖先たちの怒りに触れた結果なんだわ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544767,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Nay, mayhap... 'twas a goodly spirit in truth,\r\nyet you roused its wrath, so it came forth in\r\nfiend form...?",
        "Jp" : "いえ、もしかしたら――\r\n本当はよい精霊だったのに、あなたが怒らせたから\r\nデーモンの姿で出てきたんじゃないかしらね？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544768,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If we keep quiet, this\r\ndisturbance should settle anon.\r\nI'm thinking of telling the Chief\r\nas much, as a protest.",
        "Jp" : "静かにしていれば、じきにこの騒動も収まるはずです\r\n族長にもそういって抗議しようと\r\n思ってるところですよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544769,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Lest you wit more of fiends than I, and bring\r\nproper investigation results\r\nto show 'tis not so.\r\nThen it's a different matter...",
        "Jp" : "あなたがわたしよりもデーモンに詳しくて\r\nちゃんとした調査結果を持ってきて\r\n「そんなことはない」って言えるなら\r\n話は別ですけど――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544770,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
