    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "W-What?!\r\nYou actually went out to to uncover the\r\nfiend’s true identity?!\r\nDon’t you value your life at all?!",
        "Jp" : "な、なんてこと\r\n実際にデーモンの正体を暴くために\r\n調査に行ってきたですって！？\r\nあなたは命が惜しくないのですか！？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544772,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hii— Wh-what is this...!?\r\nShoving something queer in my face of a sudden—!?",
        "Jp" : "ひっ――\r\nな、何なんですコレは！？\r\n突然変なものを突き付けて―ー！？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516345,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Eh—\r\nThis beast... 'twas made a fiend's prey—!?\r\nAnd this... a piece of fiend's flesh—!?",
        "Jp" : "えー―\r\nこれはデーモンの餌食になった獣――！？\r\nこっちは、デーモンの肉片――！？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544773,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What a dreadful...  \r\nI...Indeed, 'tis not the work of a goodly spirit.\r\nNor does it seem to be any hex...",
        "Jp" : "なんという禍々しい――\r\nた、確かに良い精霊の仕業では\r\n決して無いようですね\r\nそれに、何かの呪いでもなさそう――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544774,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 15,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Yes, this is surely the work of a cruel monster.\r\nUnderstood, so prithee take this away—",
        "Jp" : "ええ、これは残忍な魔物による仕業でしょうね\r\nもうわかりましたから\r\nこんなものあっちにやってください――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544775,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 16,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I'll not go to the Chief to protest— If such\r\nfearful monsters are increasing, taking some\r\nmeasure is only natural, is it not?",
        "Jp" : "族長に抗議しに行くのは――やめにします\r\nこんな恐ろしい魔物が増えているのなら\r\n何らかの対策を講じるのも、当然ですものね"
      },
